  "description": "While being chased by evil spirits as usual, Yeon-Ju meets Seong-Jun, who has a unique constitution, similar to his, yet different. Although their relationship began as a contractual arrangement to alleviate each other’s physical conditions, Yeon-Ju gradually finds himself falling for Seong-Jun, who treats him like a baby and takes special care of him...\n\n*“Since I’ve already lost my conscience, why don’t we spend the whole night doing what Yeon-Ju likes?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
